.TH FASTAPI\-CLOUD\-LOGS "1" "March 2026" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.B fastapi\ cloud\ logs
\(en Stream or fetch logs from your deployed app.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fastapi\ cloud\ logs
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ PATH ]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-tail, \-t\ \fIINTEGER
Number of log lines to show before streaming.
[default:
.BR 100 ]
.TP
.B \-\-since, \-s\ \fITEXT
Show logs since a specific time (e.g.,
.RB \(oq 5m \(cq,
.RB \(oq 1h \(cq,
.RB \(oq 2d \(cq).
[default:
.BR 5m ]
.TP
.B \-\-follow, \-f, \-\-no\-follow
Stream logs in real-time
(use
.B \-\-no\-follow
to fetch and exit).
[default:
.BR follow ]
.TP
.B \-\-help\fR, \fB\-h
Show a help message and exit.
.SS "ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I PATH
Path to the folder containing the app (defaults to current directory).
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
.B #\ Stream\ logs\ in\ real\-time
.B fastapi\ cloud\ logs
.EE
.P
.EX
.B #\ Fetch\ recent\ logs\ and\ exit
.B fastapi\ cloud\ logs\ \-\-no\-follow
.EE
.P
.EX
.B #\ Last\ 50\ logs\ from\ the\ past\ hour
.B fastapi\ cloud\ logs\ \-\-tail\ 50\ \-\-since\ 1h
.EE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-deploy (1),
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-link (1),
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-login (1),
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-logout (1),
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-whoami (1),
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-unlink (1),
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-setup\-ci (1),
.BR fastapi\-cloud\-env (1)
.P
.BR fastapi\-cloud (1)
.P
.BR fastapi (1)
